Package: FactorialSurvey
Type: Package
Title: Design and Analysis of Factorial Survey (Vignette) Experiments
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Katsuya", "Tanaka", , "katsuyat@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: An integrated workflow for factorial survey (vignette) experiments.
    Constructs D-efficient sets of vignettes from a factorial structure,
    allocates them to blocks and to respondents in carryover-balanced orders,
    renders them as prose, writes them out for survey platforms, estimates
    models for bounded rating outcomes using beta regression, and derives
    average marginal effects and marginal willingness to pay with delta-method
    standard errors. Efficient designs and optimal blocking are obtained with
    the exchange algorithms of Federov (1972, ISBN:0122507509) as implemented
    in 'AlgDesign'. Presentation orders follow Williams (1949)
    <doi:10.1071/CH9490149>. Beta regression follows Ferrari and Cribari-Neto
    (2004) <doi:10.1080/0266476042000214501>. Bounded ratings are mapped to
    the open unit interval following Smithson and Verkuilen (2006)
    <doi:10.1037/1082-989X.11.1.54>.
